# Route: guide 38 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 55 to
# 56, 26 quests, 3.4 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Eastern Plaguelands, Searing Gorge): Light's Hope Chapel -> The
# Infectis Scar -> Light's Hope Chapel -> Darrowshire -> The Undercroft ->
# Terrordale -> Light's Hope Chapel -> Quel'Lithien Lodge -> Light's Hope
# Chapel -> The Fungal Vale -> The Undercroft -> Thondroril River ->
# Terrordale -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Rise, Obsidion! (3566; Lathoric
# the Black 52, Obsidion 52).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Dawn's Gambit (4771), The Flesh Does Not Lie (5212), The
# Active Agent (5213), The Great Fras Siabi (5214), Houses of the Holy (5243),
# The Archivist (5251), Above and Beyond (5263), The Restless Souls (5282),
